  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "一提到胖可丁的毛皮啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0063D0523080D653EF4E0176846BDB76AE554AFF0100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一提到毛皮就？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0063D052306BDB76AE5C31FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么了？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E484E86FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "本该是松松软软，舒适无比。\n只要摸一摸，就根本离不开才对！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "672C8BE5662F677E677E8F6F8F6FFF0C8212900265E06BD43002000A53EA898164784E006478FF0C5C316839672C79BB4E0D5F00624D5BF9FF0100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我家胖可丁的毛皮\n不仅硬邦邦，还臭烘烘的啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4662115BB680D653EF4E0176846BDB76AE000A4E0D4EC5786C90A690A6FF0C8FD881ED70D870D87684554AFF0100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那是因为\n它特别讨厌洗澡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3662F56E04E3A000A5B837279522B8BA8538C6D176FA1300200100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我想到了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我要假装打对战，\n趁机用泡沫光线来给它洗澡！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5621160F352304E86300200100001BE01000A62118981504788C562535BF96218FF0C000A8D81673A75286CE16CAB51497EBF67657ED95B836D176FA1FF0100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让学会了泡沫光线的\n宝可梦加入你的同行队伍吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n完成准备后，就来和我搭话！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA95B664F1A4E866CE16CAB51497EBF7684000A5B9D53EF68A652A051654F607684540C884C961F4F0D5427FF0100100001BE00000A5B8C621051C65907540EFF0C5C316765548C6211642D8BDDFF0100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了把胖可丁变得干干净净，\n让学会了泡沫光线的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n宝可梦加入你的同行队伍吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E86628A80D653EF4E0153D85F975E725E7251C051C0FF0C000A8BA95B664F1A4E866CE16CAB51497EBF768400100001BE00000A5B9D53EF68A652A051654F607684540C884C961F4F0D5427FF0100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
