      "displayText": "莫非……它是讨厌我粘着它摸来摸去，\n所以才把毛皮弄脏的吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83AB975E202620265B83662F8BA8538C62117C9877405B8364786765647853BBFF0C000A62404EE5624D628A6BDB76AE5F04810F76845417FF1F00100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喂～！\n等等～等等我啊，胖可丁！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
